# Goal:
#   - Improve spatial locality for A and R in the j>k update region.
#   - Preserve the exact arithmetic order for each R[k, j] accumulation
#     so that floating-point results match the original implementation.
#
# Strategy:
#   1. Fission the j-loop body into three separate j-loops:
#        (a) R[k, j] initialization,
#        (b) R[k, j] accumulation,
#        (c) A[i, j] update.
