#    i first (rows), and j second (columns). This makes j the inner loop,
#    which is contiguous in memory for both A and R (row-major layout).
#
#    Accumulation phase:  for j in ...: for i in ...:
#    becomes             for i in ...: for j in ...:
j_acc = p.find_loop("j #1")
p = reorder_loops(p, j_acc)

